      "side": 1,
      "message": "This breaks the intent of the sandbox.  As an init() function it is guaranteed to run before any init() functions in vendor plugins, as a function called from Main() it will be called much later and vendor plugins could access absolute paths.",
      "revId": "4cb0220337bd98cd5b3cea8a8cf925e02971610e",
