      "writtenOn": "2021-02-17T07:32:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You can\u0027t guarantee that this code runs after vendor plugin init functions this way, either, can you? My understanding is the only guarantee Golang gives is that if you import a package, its init() function is run before your init() function, which doesn\u0027t seem to be enough.\n\nIn that case, it would be better to set the cwd to \"/\" before running soong_build, wouldn\u0027t it? (it looks like it\u0027s easy to do, but the sandbox makes it non-trivial since it has its own ideas about what the cwd should be)",
